roundtrip [--target t] --parts unit.rtn: a unit's cache's parts as roundtrip.pl --parts prints them, each type's class, each floating constant folded, each literal's number;
src/glibc/roundtrip.pl in ff, made a part at a time (the same output: make roundtrip-crosscheck compares them; dev source: tools/dev/rtr, on tools/dev/s2ff's lib.c)
